{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjBuViG6JMhJajMAe4r6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The game works: the dial sits over the empty sky above the player, and on a portrait phone the touch message has to wrap. I'm applying those fixes, my slackline correction, and the measured table next.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3079,"cache_read_input_tokens":421108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3079},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35b0c7f2-b636-4810-bb2b-a989930a5e0b","uuid":"60fc2882-c9a4-4c5e-ba17-d3d3d3f5cfd5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:58:25.490Z","request_id":"req_011CgjBuVQuwQdQF5Xbtbt1d","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjBuViG6JMhJajMAe4r6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015sowzMk7NytiXDpNvu24NX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211859__xc93ff1/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path('PLAN.md'); s = p.read_text()\ndef rep(a, b, n=1):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(a) >= 1, a[:70]\n    s = s.replace(a, b) if n == 0 else s.replace(a, b, n)\n\n# 1. Exact measured table, from the plan's own Dot class\nrep(\"\"\"| idle | 14% | 8% | 5% | 3% |\n| sloppy | 20% | 12% | 7% | 4% |\n| average | 70% | 50% | 31% | 18% |\n| good | 99% | 93% | 73% | 48% |\n| expert | 100% | 100% | 98% | 80% |\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| idle | 11% | 7% | 4% | 2% |\n| sloppy | 21% | 13% | 7% | 4% |\n| average | 71% | 51% | 31% | 18% |\n| good | 100% | 93% | 74% | 49% |\n| expert | 100% | 100% | 98% | 79% |\"\"\")\n\n# 2. Slackline: the simulated values are effective instability, not multipliers\nrep(\"\"\"- Defaults ✔ (simulated): `m.inst` 1.2 standing, 2.6 walking; noise ×1.25; gusts every 6 m, ±1.6 force for 1 s, telegraphed 1.5 s by flags and wind lines; fall at `|x| > 1`.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"- Defaults ✔ (simulated): effective instability 1.2 standing and 2.6 walking, so `m.inst = 1.2 / T.dotInstability` and `T.slackWalkInst / T.dotInstability`; `m.noise` 1.25; gusts every 6 m, `m.bx` ±1.6 for 1 s, telegraphed 1.5 s by flags and wind lines; fall at `|x| > 1`. Lock y (`dot.y = dot.vy = 0` after each step). Bots walk only while `|x| < .45`.\"\"\")\n\n# 3. Dial placement\nrep(\"\"\"- Never draw the dial over the avatar. Place it left of the player at about (W×0.2, H×0.6).\"\"\",\n\"\"\"- Never draw the dial over an avatar. In 3-mat staging the sky above the player's head is empty: centre the dial at (W/2, 56), radius 44.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"so lanes read `navigator.getGamepads()` by index themselves (`applyDeadzone` is exported; guard for Node). Up to 4 small dials under the mats. Podium, rematch.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"so lanes read `navigator.getGamepads()` by index themselves (`applyDeadzone` is exported; guard for Node). In 4-mat staging, each player gets a small dial (radius 24) above their avatar's head. Podium, rematch.\"\"\")\n\n# 4. Touch-only: narrow art, button verified\nrep(\"\"\"Show over the title: **\"Controller or keyboard required\"**. Attract runs and loops.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"✔ The ⚙ appears and a tap opens the engine's panel. Show over the title: **\"Controller or keyboard required\"**, wrapped: a portrait phone's art is as narrow as 168 px wide. Attract runs and loops.\"\"\")\n\n# 5. Build comment\nrep(\"\"\"// tools/build.mjs (after esbuild 0.28; build time is under a second)\"\"\", \"\"\"// tools/build.mjs (esbuild is on this machine)\"\"\")\n\n# 6. Medley durations live in data\nrep(\"\"\"The specific picks come from a seeded stream. Each event normalises to 0-1000; the total wins.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"The specific picks and shortened durations live in `src/data/medley.js`, and the picks come from a seeded stream. Each event normalises to 0-1000; the total wins.\"\"\")\n\n# 7. Song level test made concrete\nrep(\"\"\"- **Write instruments loud:** track `volume` 0.45-0.8. The kit's examples use about 0.12, written for a 60% bus; at 10% × master .8 that is near silence. A test checks the song's peak level.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"- **Write instruments loud:** track `volume` 0.45-0.8. The kit's examples use about 0.12, written for a 60% bus; at 10% × master .8 that is near silence. A test checks each song: sum of track volumes × 0.1 × 0.8 ≥ 0.03.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"`parseSong` on every song; song peak level at 10% audible; every line fits\"\"\", \"\"\"`parseSong` on every song; each song passes the level check in §15; every line fits\"\"\")\n\n# 8. Feel check that a builder without hands can actually do\nrep(\"\"\"3. **One activity, fully.** Holding Still end to end with avatars, Coach, results, voice and music. **Stop and judge the feel here**; this is the whole game in miniature.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"3. **One activity, fully.** Holding Still end to end with avatars, Coach, results, voice and music. **Stop and judge the feel here**, since this is the whole game in miniature: check the bot table, then capture a run as frames and confirm the body language reads the Dot.\"\"\")\n\n# 9. One compact Engine.start\nrep(\"\"\"**Engine patterns:**\n- Each scene is a `Game`\"\"\",\n\"\"\"**Engine patterns:**\n- Start ✔: `Engine.start(new Boot(), withUrlOptions({ container: document.getElementById('app'), aspect: 'fill', touch: false, settings: { button: touchOnly ? 'top-right' : false }, quality: info ? 'medium' : 'high', seed, background: PALETTE.sky, camera }))`.\n- Each scene is a `Game`\"\"\")\np.write_text(s)\nEOF\necho \"--- forbidden names:\"; grep -n -i \"TASK\\.md\\|STAGE\\.md\\|PLAN\\.md\\|exit-interview\\.json\\|GameTitle\\|claude-opus\\|20261104\\|planner-exit\" PLAN.md; echo \"--- title leak check (Wii words outside the intended places):\"; grep -n \"Wii\\|Mii\\|Wuhu\" PLAN.md | cut -c1-150; echo \"--- size:\"; wc -w PLAN.md; wc -c PLAN.md; echo \"--- headings:\"; grep -n \"^## \" PLAN.md; echo \"--- sample lines over 3x52 chars:\"; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ns=open('PLAN.md').read()\nsec=s[s.index('## 8. Writing'):s.index('## 9. UI')]\nfor m in re.finditer(r'\"([^\"]{20,})\"', sec):\n    t=m.group(1)\n    if len(t)>156: print(len(t),t)\nprint('checked')\nEOF","description":"Apply fixes to the plan and check it for forbidden names and limits"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3079,"cache_read_input_tokens":421108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3079},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"c