ng start, not proof it feels good.\n- Only the balance model and slackline were simulated; the other activities' tuning numbers are my estimates, and the plan's tests and dev sliders are there to correct them.\n- The voice synth is a written design that I didn't prototype.\n- The rhythm beat clock and voice routing rely on undocumented engine internals I read in the code but didn't run.\n\n**My interpretation to check:** I read \"multiplayer… for the game on its own\" as solo play plus 1–4 players on one screen, with online play only through the hub. The brief is ambiguous here, so if you meant standalone online play, that section of the plan needs to change. This is also the first item in the exit interview's \"What was confusing?\" answer.\n\nI deleted my scratch folder and made no commits. The work folder now holds only `PLAN.md`, `planner-exit-interview.json` and the two original files.","ttft_ms":1267,"type":"result","duration_ms":2527794,"uuid":"94680816-2e69-4724-8309-7286f402e532","ttft_stream_ms":976,"time_to_request_ms":84,"first_content_frame_ms":976,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":122,"outputTokens":240385,"cacheReadInputTokens":14936923,"cacheCreationInputTokens":432895,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":11.258732600000004,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":131924,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":432895,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":1224,"cacheReadInputTokens":872,"cacheCreationInputTokens":305701,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.194168725,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":878,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":305701,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-03T10:5